        <h3>What Is Tracking Shield?</h3>

        <p>Our Express tier includes a feature we call <strong>Tracking Shield</strong>. Standard tracking updates reveal the package origin city, which can be cross-referenced with vendor locations. With Tracking Shield, we route the package through a secondary distribution hub — usually a major logistics center like Memphis or Louisville — before it enters the carrier network. The tracking origin shows the hub city, not our facility location. This adds a critical layer of geographic obfuscation without delaying delivery.</p>

