                <div class="tip-text"><strong>Ordering to a New Address</strong>A first-time delivery to an address with zero mail history is more likely to be scrutinized. If possible, establish normal mail flow before ordering sensitive items.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
                <div class="tip-icon tip-good">✓</div>
