            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>What Happens If Something Goes Wrong</h2>

        <p>Lost packages are rare, but they happen. Weather delays, carrier misroutes, and address errors are realities of logistics. Here is our protocol for each scenario.</p>

        <p><strong>Delayed tracking:</strong> If tracking has not updated in 72 hours, we initiate a carrier trace. This is invisible to you — we do not want you calling the carrier and creating a customer service record. We handle everything from our side.</p>

        <p><strong>Returned to sender:</strong> If a package is returned due to an address error, we do not re-ship to the same address. We contact you for verification, confirm the corrected address, and reship with upgraded packaging at no extra cost.</p>

        <p><strong>Seized by customs:</strong> International orders that hit customs holds are not pursued. We do not contact customs. We do not claim the package. We simply write it off and reship a replacement via an alternate route. This is built into our Stealth tier pricing.</p>

        <blockquote>
            "The safest package is the one nobody is looking for. Our entire logistics philosophy is built on blending in, not standing out."
